---
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 sm:py-24 border-b border-gray-100 bg-[#FFFFFF]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 w-full">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Profile Photo Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="relative max-w-sm mx-auto lg:max-w-none">
          <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm relative group">
            <img 
              src="/images/profile.jpg" 
              alt="Foto profil Mohamad Arifin Hasbi, mahasiswa Teknik Informatika STMIK Mardira Indonesia"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
              width="400"
              height="400"
            />
          </div>
          <!-- Decorative accent box -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-32 h-32 bg-blue-50/80 rounded-2xl -z-10 border border-blue-100 hidden sm:block"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div 
          data-i18n="aboutEyebrow"
          class="inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0047FF] mb-2"
        >
          About Me
        </div>
        
        <h2 
          data-i18n="aboutTitle"
          class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-[#000000] mb-6"
        >
          Informatics Student with a Passion for Full Stack Engineering
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-base text-[#4B5563] leading-relaxed mb-8">
          <p data-i18n="aboutBio1">
            I am an active 6th-semester student pursuing Informatics Engineering at STMIK Mardira Indonesia with a 3.64/4.00 GPA. I have a deep passion for modern software engineering, scalable backend architecture, and responsive user interfaces.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="aboutBio2">
            Throughout my studies, I have developed web systems using Java (Spring Boot), PHP (Laravel, CodeIgniter), and JavaScript/TypeScript (React, Astro). Experienced in Clean Architecture principles, REST API standards, and relational database management (MySQL, PostgreSQL).
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Relevan Mata Kuliah Highlight -->
        <div class="mb-8 p-4 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#1F2937] mb-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#0047FF]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H20"/></svg>
            <span data-i18n="aboutCoursesTitle">Relevant Coursework</span>
          </div>
          <p data-i18n="aboutCoursesList" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4B5563]">
            Object-Oriented Programming (OOP), Software Engineering, Databases, Web Programming, Expert Systems, Data Structures &amp; Algorithms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Stats Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-gray-100 shadow-xs text-center sm:text-left">
            <div data-i18n="aboutStat1Value" class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#000000]">3+</div>
            <div data-i18n="aboutStat1Label" class="text-xs text-[#6B7280] font-medium mt-0.5">Core Projects</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-gray-100 shadow-xs text-center sm:text-left">
            <div data-i18n="aboutStat2Value" class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#0047FF]">3.64</div>
            <div data-i18n="aboutStat2Label" class="text-xs text-[#6B7280] font-medium mt-0.5">GPA / 4.00</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-gray-100 shadow-xs text-center sm:text-left">
            <div data-i18n="aboutStat3Value" class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#000000]">Sem 6</div>
            <div data-i18n="aboutStat3Label" class="text-xs text-[#6B7280] font-medium mt-0.5">STMIK Mardira</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
